physical source pair `(q3_j, r3_j)`.  The parameter of that solver is the angular-momentum
coefficient *of the order being solved*, and there is no `ε³` angular parameter in the test
family (`J_ε = ε j`), so the call is `0`; the physical `j` enters only through the source.

